    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Torrent of Information</>'s initial <HighLight>Mysterious Knowledge</> cost and subsequent <HighLight>Mysterious Knowledge</> cost increases are both reduced by 3; <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Eyes of Mystery Prying</> damage is increased by 53%."] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">TПоток информацииПервоначальная стоимость <HighLight>Mysterious Knowledge</> и последующее увеличение стоимости <HighLight>Mysterious Knowledge</> уменьшены на 3; <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Таинственные глаза. Урон </> увеличен на 53%.",
